[I] Compositor for the COSMIC desktop environment

[T] Compositor for the COSMIC desktop environment.

[U] https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-comp/

[A] System76 <info@system76.com>
[M] NoTag <notag@t2sde.org>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 1.10.0

[CV-GROUP] cosmic-desktop
[D] 5daa093f84846d6c100dbfea3cc7411ab7139ca38ae8d317e3ee4e49 cosmic-comp-epoch-1.10.0.tar.gz https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-comp/archive/epoch-1.10.0/

. $base/package/cosmic/*/cosmic-conf.in

hook_add prepatch 5 cargo_vendor
hook_add postmake 5 'install -Dm0644 data/keybindings.ron $root$datadir/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Shortcuts/v1/defaults'
hook_add postmake 5 'install -Dm0644 data/tiling-exceptions.ron $root$datadir/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.WindowRules/v1/tiling_exception_defaults'
